foundation.question_text:
Two ribbons are shown.
Ribbon A is $8$ cm long and ribbon B is $12$ cm long.
Mia has $\tfrac{1}{2}$ of ribbon A and Noah has $\tfrac{1}{2}$ of ribbon B.
Who has the longer piece?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.55cm,y=0.55cm]
\fill[blue!25] (0,1.5) rectangle (4,2.5);
\draw (0,1.5) rectangle (8,2.5);
\draw (4,1.5)--(4,2.5);
\node[left] at (0,2) {A};
\fill[orange!30] (0,0) rectangle (6,1);
\draw (0,0) rectangle (12,1);
\draw (6,0)--(6,1);
\node[left] at (0,0.5) {B};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
